:"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-22T20:58:47Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T22:26:19Z","closed_at":"2026-11-22T22:26:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otpanda/extension/pulls/1","html_url":"https://github.com/otpanda/extension/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/otpanda/extension/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/otpanda/extension/pull/1.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-22T22:26:19Z"},"body":"## Scope\n- Manifest V3 shell with no host permissions, content scripts, background tasks or token storage.\n- Disconnected popup in light/dark styles, with a disabled connection button and honest incomplete status.\n- Proposed transport boundary: HTTPS origin only, bearer token excluded from URLs, no cookies/referrers, redirects rejected, bounded response body, service binding and expiration checks.\n- Eight tests, including cross-service/malformed/oversized responses, access denial, transport error redaction and permission checks.\n\n## Verification\nFreshly cloned the remote branch and ran `npm test` on Node 22: 8/8 passing. Rendered and visually inspected the popup in light and dark themes at 350px width. Extension installation and Firefox packaging are not verified.\n\n## Limitations\nNot connected to a live API. No actual sign-in, code collection/fill, clipboard access, account credentials, deployment or billing. Transport contract is proposed and must be aligned with the API before use. Clock integrity, authentication and production security controls remain future work. See FOUNDATION.md if present for setup and boundaries.\n\nPlease review and merge when ready.","closed_by":{"login":"abrahammurciano","id":25041135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQxMTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25041135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano","html_url":"https://github.com/abrahammurciano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otpanda/extension/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otpanda/extension/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]
